# CORTEX VIDEO: the computer stops reading the FM-1's SysEx for a while (busy, a screen reader's words in the way):
# the frames wait and go in order after, the same ones; no SYNC again, nothing for the mirror to lose
# (tests/follow_test.c reads out:stall.syx: one SYNC, no gap, no disagreement)
wait 500
usbaudio 220
sysex_log out:stall.syx
sysex F0 7D 43 56 10 00 01 F7
wait 600
turn SELECT 3
spin K1 8
usb stall
wait 400
usb read
wait 600
sysex F0 7D 43 56 10 00 01 F7
usb stall
spin K2 10
wait 250
usb read
wait 1200
sysex F0 7D 43 56 10 00 01 F7
wait 600
sysex_log off
